N.1754="label"*179x22<M>
n="Lead compressor is the first one that comes on first
and handles the base load. Next the Lag compressors 
come on. There is one Lead compressor and 
up to three Lag compressors

LeadLagVec(1) = Lead Channel No
LeadLagVec(2) = Lag Channel No with longest On time
LeadLagVec(3) = Lag Channel No with shorter On time
LeadLagVec(4) = Lag Channel No with shortest On time

LeadLagVec(5) = LeadLagVec(1) On time value
LeadLagVec(6) = LeadLagVec(2) On time value
LeadLagVec(7) = LeadLagVec(3) On time value
LeadLagVec(8) = LeadLagVec(4) On time value

NOTE: if On time value = 0, that channel is off"
